{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"yaoci-e-o032","title":"刘基年十四居刘繇丧尽礼，故吏馈饷皆无所受","accounts":[{"id":"yaoci-a-504ed959eca1748e8f3e","label":"正文","text":"刘基年十四居刘繇丧尽礼，故吏馈饷皆无所受","evidence":["yaoci-q-24fab792864206916d01"]}],"participants":[{"person":"yaoci-p0002","role":"居丧尽礼者","evidence":["yaoci-q-24fab792864206916d01"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原文时间表达；各账户以所引文献为准。","evidence":["yaoci-q-24fab792864206916d01"]},"ordering_evidence":"yaoci-q-24fab792864206916d01","source_order":[49,48,9],"order":8954},{"id":"yaoci-e-o036","title":"骑都尉虞翻醉酒犯忤孙权，权欲杀之，由刘基谏争，翻以得免","accounts":[{"id":"yaoci-a-3813f5782766e95bf3d0","label":"正文","text":"骑都尉虞翻醉酒犯忤孙权，权欲杀之，由刘基谏争，翻以得免","evidence":["yaoci-q-adc0ce4b3172798952a0"]},{"id":"yululu-a-b60c2a1329fee62c7b0a","label":"正文","text":"吴王欢宴行酒，虞翻佯醉不持，权大怒手剑欲击之","evidence":["yululu-q-4df3fb5fbebe4d1f5254"]},{"id":"yululu-a-0fbf21ea84f1dedb3398","label":"正文","text":"刘基起抱权谏止杀虞翻，翻由是得免","evidence":["yululu-q-ea07f8f48a2052df32b2"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"怒而欲杀者","evidence":["yaoci-q-adc0ce4b3172798952a0"]},{"person":"zhouyu-p0058","role":"醉而犯忤被谏救者","evidence":["yaoci-q-adc0ce4b3172798952a0"]},{"person":"yaoci-p0002","role":"谏争者","evidence":["yaoci-q-adc0ce4b3172798952a0"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原文时间表达；各账户以所引文献为准。","evidence":["yaoci-q-adc0ce4b3172798952a0"]},"ordering_evidence":"yaoci-q-adc0ce4b3172798952a0","source_order":[49,49,0],"order":8955},{"id":"yaoci-e-o037","title":"孙权大暑时于船中宴饮值雷雨，以盖自覆又命覆刘基，余人不得也","accounts":[{"id":"yaoci-a-194ff3d177a821497df7","label":"正文","text":"孙权大暑时于船中宴饮值雷雨，以盖自覆又命覆刘基，余人不得也","evidence":["yaoci-q-a28dc3f96ebe09e003e2"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"命人遮盖者","evidence":["yaoci-q-a28dc3f96ebe09e003e2"]},{"person":"yaoci-p0002","role":"获遮盖者","evidence":["yaoci-q-a28dc3f96ebe09e003e2"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原文时间表达；各账户以所引文献为准。","evidence":["yaoci-q-a28dc3f96ebe09e003e2"]},"ordering_evidence":"yaoci-q-a28dc3f96ebe09e003e2","source_order":[49,49,39],"order":8956},{"id":"yaoci-e-o040","title":"刘基卒，年四十九","accounts":[{"id":"yaoci-a-40a68ddb8d2dd69d9cfd","label":"正文","text":"刘基卒，年四十九","evidence":["yaoci-q-2b4ae3e65aa2d862d2d5"]}],"participants":[{"person":"yaoci-p0002","role":"卒者","evidence":["yaoci-q-2b4ae3e65aa2d862d2d5"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原文时间表达；各账户以所引文献为准。","evidence":["yaoci-q-2b4ae3e65aa2d862d2d5"]},"ordering_evidence":"yaoci-q-2b4ae3e65aa2d862d2d5","source_order":[49,50,26],"order":8957},{"id":"yululu-e-54ec47244e2cb953ddaa","title":"权问公卿张温与谁为比，刘基谓可与全琮为辈，顾雍谓温当今无辈","accounts":[{"id":"yululu-a-54ec47244e2cb953ddaa","label":"正文","text":"权问公卿张温与谁为比，刘基谓可与全琮为辈，顾雍谓温当今无辈","evidence":["yululu-q-1a82bcc0db110934ce8f"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"询问","evidence":["yululu-q-1a82bcc0db110934ce8f"]},{"person":"yaoci-p0002","role":"对答","evidence":["yululu-q-1a82bcc0db110934ce8f"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0045","role":"对答","evidence":["yululu-q-1a82bcc0db110934ce8f"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["yululu-q-1a82bcc0db110934ce8f"]},"ordering_evidence":"yululu-q-1a82bcc0db110934ce8f","order":10179}],"persons":[{"id":"yaoci-p0002","name":"刘基","evidence":["yaoci-q-24fab792864206916d01","yaoci-q-adc0ce4b3172798952a0","yaoci-q-a28dc3f96ebe09e003e2","yaoci-q-2b4ae3e65aa2d862d2d5","yaoci-q-30f312b2eb4ed0a35817","yaoci-q2-1147d8238dc3a39e1259","yaoci-q2-0ed810d763f289aca37b","yaoci-q2-53de46c5afa041f0fcd3","yululu-q-ea07f8f48a2052df32b2","yululu-q-1a82bcc0db110934ce8f","yululu-q-abeb3217085c0f9422a8","yululu-q-9922c0493b7d96c7ca8d"],"facts":[{"id":"yaoci-f2-0264eec2e9fb105d00d7","text":"孙权为骠骑将军时，辟为东曹掾；拜辅义校尉、建忠中郎将；孙权为吴王，迁基为大农。","evidence":["yaoci-q2-1147d8238dc3a39e1259"]},{"id":"yaoci-f2-2a9a7478e3009f88d19e","text":"徙郎中令；孙权称尊号，改为光禄勋，分平尚书事。","evidence":["yaoci-q2-0ed810d763f289aca37b"]},{"id":"yaoci-f2-92aba1b523602794c275","text":"其女纳为孙霸妃，赐宅；基子铄为尚骑都尉，四时宠赐。","evidence":["yaoci-q2-53de46c5afa041f0fcd3"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"yaoci-m2-b57ae0096297917facc4","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["yaoci-q-30f312b2eb4ed0a35817"]},{"id":"yululu-m-3ea7cb22c39b7c5836f7","kind":"mention","text":"本篇原文记及刘基，具体行动与称谓见引文。","evidence":["yululu-q-abeb3217085c0f9422a8"]},{"id":"yululu-m-7315369db5ab25ea7ec2","kind":"mention","text":"本篇原文记及刘基，具体行动与称谓见引文。","evidence":["yululu-q-9922c0493b7d96c7ca8d"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"yaoci-q-24fab792864206916d01","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-3655ef9227fdfaec0414","layer":"original","quote":"年十四，居繇丧，尽礼；故吏馈饷〖22〗，皆无所受","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":47,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":9,"end":33,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-2b4ae3e65aa2d862d2d5","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-b057b7ae6aa7add4da9b","layer":"original","quote":"年四十九卒","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":49,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":26,"end":31,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-30f312b2eb4ed0a35817","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-2f17a96cb44e22570a99","layer":"original","quote":"后权为子霸，纳基女；赐第一区","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":50,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":14,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-a28dc3f96ebe09e003e2","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-3f06c5f2959364ec2790","layer":"original","quote":"权大暑时，尝于船中宴饮，于船楼上值雷雨〖27〗；权以盖自覆，又命覆基，余人不得也","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":48,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":39,"end":79,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-adc0ce4b3172798952a0","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-3f06c5f2959364ec2790","layer":"original","quote":"权尝宴饮，骑都尉虞翻醉酒犯忤〖26〗；权欲杀之，威怒甚盛：由基谏争，翻以得免","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":48,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q2-0ed810d763f289aca37b","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-b057b7ae6aa7add4da9b","layer":"original","quote":"徙郎中令。权称尊号，改为光禄勋；分平尚书事〖28〗。年四十九卒。","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":49,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":32,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q2-1147d8238dc3a39e1259","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-3655ef9227fdfaec0414","layer":"original","quote":"繇长子基，字敬舆。年十四，居繇丧，尽礼；故吏馈饷〖22〗，皆无所受。﹝一﹞姿容美好，孙权爱敬之。权为骠骑将军，辟东曹掾〖23〗。拜辅义校尉、建忠中郎将〖24〗。权为吴王，迁基大农〖25〗。","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":47,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":94,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q2-53de46c5afa041f0fcd3","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-2f17a96cb44e22570a99","layer":"original","quote":"后权为子霸，纳基女；赐第一区〖29〗。四时宠赐，与全、张比〖30〗。基二弟：铄、尚，皆骑都尉。","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":50,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-1a82bcc0db110934ce8f","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-0821c8300c19c470958b","layer":"original","quote":"权闻之，以问公卿曰：“温当今与谁为比〔也〕？”大司农刘基曰：“可与全琮为辈。”太常顾雍曰〖1〗：“基未详其为人也。温当今无辈〖2〗！”权曰：“如是，张允不死也","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":156,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":48,"end":127,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-4df3fb5fbebe4d1f5254","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-807acbba5821deec1897","layer":"original","quote":"权既为吴王，欢宴之末，自起行酒。翻伏地佯醉，不持〖1〗；权去，翻起坐。权于是大怒，手剑欲击之","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":73,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":46,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-9922c0493b7d96c7ca8d","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-0821c8300c19c470958b","layer":"original","quote":"张温字惠恕，吴郡〔吴〕人也。父允，以轻财重士，名显州郡。为孙权东曹掾，卒。温少修节操，容貌奇伟。权闻之，以问公卿曰：“温当今与谁为比〔也〕？”大司农刘基曰：“可与全琮为辈。”太常顾雍曰〖1〗：“基未详其为人也。温当今无辈〖2〗！”权曰：“如是，张允不死也！”征到（延）〔廷〕见，文辞占对，观者倾竦〖3〗，权改容加礼〖4〗。罢出，张昭执其手曰：“老夫托意，君宜明之。”拜议郎，选曹尚书〖5〗。徙太子太傅，甚见信重，时年三十二。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":156,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":212,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-abeb3217085c0f9422a8","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-807acbba5821deec1897","layer":"original","quote":"权既为吴王，欢宴之末，自起行酒。翻伏地佯醉，不持〖1〗；权去，翻起坐。权于是大怒，手剑欲击之〖2〗；侍坐者莫不惶遽，惟大司农刘基起抱权谏曰〖3〗：“大王以三爵之后手杀善士〖4〗，虽翻有罪，天下孰知之？且大王以能容贤蓄众，故海内望风；今一朝弃之，可乎？”权曰：“曹孟德尚杀孔文举〖5〗，孤于虞翻何有哉！”基曰：“孟德轻害士人，天下非之。大王躬行德义，欲与尧、舜比隆〖6〗：何得自喻于彼乎？”翻由是得免。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":73,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":200,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-ea07f8f48a2052df32b2","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-807acbba5821deec1897","layer":"original","quote":"惟大司农刘基起抱权谏曰〖3〗：“大王以三爵之后手杀善士〖4〗，虽翻有罪，天下孰知之？且大王以能容贤蓄众，故海内望风；今一朝弃之，可乎？”权曰：“曹孟德尚杀孔文举〖5〗，孤于虞翻何有哉！”基曰：“孟德轻害士人，天下非之。大王躬行德义，欲与尧、舜比隆〖6〗：何得自喻于彼乎？”翻由是得免","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":73,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":58,"end":199,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
